<title>THAILAND: Thai tapioca pellets ship loadings.</title>
<headline>Thai tapioca pellets ship loadings.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following ships were loading or announced at Bangkok port, the Thai tapioca association said.</p>
<p>    Departure	    Charter	 Date	   Tonnes</p>
<p>    BAIA DE CRIS	   (ACT)	 18/05/97     57,000</p>
<p>    QIN HAI		  (IAT)	 22/05/97     38,000</p>
<p>    DELTA PRIDE	    (STC)	 24/05/97     50,000</p>
<p>    SEAL		     (IAT)	 29/05/97     34,000</p>
<p>    YUAN DA		  (ACT)	 31/05/97     10,000</p>
<p>In Port</p>
<p>    HIRAL 3		  (IAT)	 06/06/97     23,000</p>
<p>    SIAM SINCERITY	 (ACT)	 06/06/97     41,000</p>
<p>    BLUE L		   (STC)     1-15/07/97     35,000</p>
